<title>ST VINCENT: CRICKET-WEST INDIES 308 FOR SEVEN V SRI LANKA - TEA.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-WEST INDIES 308 FOR SEVEN V SRI LANKA - TEA.</headline>
<dateline>KINGSTOWN, St Vincent 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>West Indies were</p>
<p>308 for seven in their second innings at tea, a lead of 233</p>
<p>runs, on the fourth day of the second test against Sri Lanka at</p>
<p>Arnos Vale on Monday.</p>
<p>scores: West Indies 147 and 308-7 (B.Lara 115),  Sri</p>
<p>Lanka 222.</p>
</text>
